# Run 416 evidence archive — public DevNet M4 live seed Route A (real external reachability).
#
# Only publish-safe, transcribed text evidence is tracked in this directory:
#   README.md, summary.txt, SHA256SUMS.txt,
#   laptop1/{manifest.txt,dialer-process.txt,dialer-sockets.txt,dialer-log-extract.txt,dialer-metrics.txt},
#   vps/{manifest.txt,seed-process.txt,seed-sockets.txt,seed-log-extract.txt,seed-metrics.txt}.
#
# The raw operator-side capture bundles were produced on the seed VPS and the
# off-host dialer laptop and are NOT committed. They may contain absolute paths,
# full host process tables, raw logs / metrics dumps, and — critically — the
# temporary DevNet PQC material (ML-DSA-44 root signing key, ML-KEM-768 leaf
# secret) generated by `devnet_pqc_root_helper`. None of that private material
# may ever be committed. The bundles below are gitignored as a backstop.
bundles/
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.tar
# Any raw material that must never be committed.
material/
node-data/
nodes/
logs/
data/
*.kem.sk.bin
*.cert.bin
*.root.bin
*.signing.key
*.sk.bin
*.hex
*.spec
*.err
*.log
public-identity.json